{"ID":"20230927161026-t8awl6x","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927161026-t8awl6x","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161026-t8awl6x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161030-v5ozwon\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161030-yq4gqct\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161030-yq4gqct\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:76,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:76\u0026#125;","title":"【开骨散】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927161030"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927161030-v5ozwon","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927161030-v5ozwon","updated":"20230927161030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"由佛手散加味而成"}]},{"ID":"20230927161030-vl23bci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927161030-vl23bci","updated":"20230927161030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：当归一两（30克） 川芎五钱（15克）  败龟板八钱（24克）血余一团烧灰  加生黄耆四两（120克）"}]},{"ID":"20230927161030-fvyzgvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927161030-fvyzgvj","updated":"20230927161030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"败龟板：自然死亡的乌龟壳"}]},{"ID":"20230927161030-5obb6kc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927161030-5obb6kc","updated":"20230927161030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血余：既为头发，血余一团烧灰，即血余炭，它味苦性温，能消於也能止血，可预防难产时引起的大出血。"}]},{"ID":"20230927161030-nniio79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927161030-nniio79","updated":"20230927161030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当归是妇科圣药，养血和血。"}]},{"ID":"20230927161030-j5ljai1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927161030-j5ljai1","updated":"20230927161030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎是血中气药，活血行气，祛风止痛。"}]},{"ID":"20230927161030-yq4gqct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927161030-yq4gqct","updated":"20230927161030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生黄芪：一般保健或治疗中使用的黄芪指的是生黄芪，其补气的功效大名鼎鼎，生产时最需要的便是气的推动了。和当归配，气行血行，有利生产。配龟板升提益阴止崩漏。"}]}]}